{%- comment -%}
  Renders the ship-by countdown: "Ships today if you order within the next 3h 42m."

  Accepts:
  - show_info: {Boolean} adds an info button that discloses the cutoff rule in
    a small popover. The cart page has room for it; the popup does not.

  Usage:
  {% render 'shipping-countdown', show_info: true %}

  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
  THE SHIPPING RULES LIVE HERE. Edit the assigns below and every surface that
  renders this snippet follows — there is nothing to change in the JS.

    shipping_timezone   IANA zone the cutoff is measured in.
    shipping_cutoff     Orders before this wall-clock time ship the same day.
    shipping_closed_weekdays  0 = Sunday … 6 = Saturday. Days we never ship.
    shipping_closed_dates     Extra one-off closures (vacation, moving week)
                              as YYYY-MM-DD, comma separated. Past dates are
                              harmless, so they can be left in place.

  USPS holidays are not listed: assets/shipping-countdown.js computes the
  eleven observed federal holidays for whatever year it is asked about, so
  they need no yearly upkeep. Set data-observe-holidays to false to ship
  through them.
  ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

  The countdown is computed client-side because it has to keep ticking, but it
  is anchored to data-now — the server's clock — so a visitor whose own clock
  is wrong by hours still sees the real ship day. See readClockSkew in the JS.

  Rendered hidden and revealed by the JS once it has a number to show, which
  avoids flashing an empty box or a wrong one.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- liquid
  assign shipping_timezone = 'America/Chicago'
  assign shipping_cutoff = '14:00'
  assign shipping_closed_weekdays = '0'
  assign shipping_closed_dates = ''
-%}

<shipping-countdown
  class="shipping-countdown{% if show_info %} shipping-countdown--roomy{% endif %}"
  data-timezone="{{ shipping_timezone }}"
  data-cutoff="{{ shipping_cutoff }}"
  data-closed-weekdays="{{ shipping_closed_weekdays }}"
  data-closed-dates="{{ shipping_closed_dates }}"
  data-observe-holidays="true"
  data-now="{{ 'now' | date: '%s' }}"
  data-show-info="{% if show_info %}true{% else %}false{% endif %}"
  hidden
></shipping-countdown>
